      title: 'Enterprise Security by Default',
      description: 'Authentication via SAML 2.0 or OIDC, role-based access control, field-level encryption for sensitive data, full audit logging. Security is tested throughout the build, including automated penetration testing before launch. Security is architecture, not a final checklist item.',
    },
    {
      icon: '<svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12"/></svg>',
      title: 'Built to Scale Under Load',
      description: 'Architecture decisions are made with growth in mind from day one. Horizontal scaling, database partitioning strategies, background job queues, and CDN-served static assets are designed so the application can grow well past its launch load without a rewrite.',
    },
    {
      icon: '<svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/><path d="M19.07 4.93a10 10 0 0 1 0 14.14M4.93 4.93a10 10 0 0 0 0 14.14"/></svg>',
      title: 'Deep System Integration',
      description: 'Custom applications rarely stand alone. We integrate with your ERP, CRM, identity providers, payment gateways, government data services, and internal APIs using patterns that are observable, retryable and resilient to third-party downtime.',
    },
    {
      icon: '<svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>',
      title: 'Designed for Your Users',
      description: 'Internal tools and customer-facing applications both demand thoughtful UX. We conduct user research, build prototypes, run usability sessions, and measure adoption after launch, so you can see whether people are actually using it.',
    },
    {
      icon: '<svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="16 18 22 12 16 6"/><polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18"/></svg>',
      title: 'You Own What You Pay For',
      description: 'You own what we build for you once it is paid for. Each part is assigned to you as it is paid for in full, you can see and test the code while we build, and the full repository, logins and accounts are handed over after the final payment. That covers source code, CI/CD pipelines, infrastructure as code, database migrations and documentation. There are no proprietary runtimes to lock you in.',
    },
