      description: 'Every build starts with a Discovery Audit ($750 plus GST, credited in full against the build). We map your workflows, pain points, requirements and risks in a written audit, then walk you through it over two strategy sessions. You receive a fixed price Schedule of Work for an agreed scope, with clear acceptance criteria.',
